      "email_subject": "The Blueprint shows the what. This shows the how.",
      "email_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>ScaleSolo</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#0c0b0f;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;color:#0c0b0f;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;\">The playbook that turns the framework into income.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#0c0b0f;padding:36px 16px;\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#141318;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #221f29;\">\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 36px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #221f29;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding-right:12px;\">\n            <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%2236%22%20height%3D%2236%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2036%2036%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22g%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%25%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23ef4444%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%22100%25%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23b91c1c%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%220%22%20y%3D%220%22%20width%3D%2236%22%20height%3D%2236%22%20rx%3D%229%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23g)%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3Cpolygon%20points%3D%2220%208%2012%2019%2018%2019%2016%2028%2024%2017%2018%2017%2020%208%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"ScaleSolo\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:9px;\">\n          </td>\n          <td style=\"vertical-align:middle;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">ScaleSolo</td>\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 36px 8px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e7e5ea;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:21px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Ready to actually build it</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">The Blueprint gives you the map. A map is great, but at some point you have to drive.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">I put the whole build into a step by step playbook. Niche selection, the content engine, posting cadence, and how to point it all at income instead of vanity views. It is <span style=\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:700;\">$17</span>. Less than lunch.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;\">\n    <tr><td style=\"border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ef4444 0%,#b91c1c 100%);\">\n      <a href=\"https://scalesolo.ai/build-your-ai-empire\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;\">Get the $17 Playbook</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">I priced it low on purpose. I would rather you take action this week than think about it for three months. If it saves you one wasted weekend it already paid for itself many times over.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;\">Talk soon,<br>Rayvaughn<br><span style=\"color:#86838f;\">Founder, Vernon Tech &amp; Media</span></p>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:18px 36px 30px;border-top:1px solid #221f29;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#86838f;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;\">\n        You are getting this because you joined ScaleSolo through Rayvaughn at Vernon Tech &amp; Media.<br>\n        Just reply if you ever want to reach me directly.<br>\n        <a href=\"https://scalesolo.ai\" style=\"color:#ef4444;text-decoration:none;\">scalesolo.ai</a>\n        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"{$unsubscribe}\" style=\"color:#86838f;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>"
